    {
      "id": "h1",
      "text": "Choosing a university is a big decision.",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "pause": 0.45
    },
    {
      "id": "h2",
      "text": "And the numbers are everywhere.",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "pause": 0.55
    },
    {
      "id": "h3",
      "text": "Seventy-four admission codes. Nine programs. Cut-offs that change every year.",
      "speed": 1.04,
      "pause": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "r1",
      "text": "So I built a counselor that knows every one of them.",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "pause": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "r2",
      "text": "Meet BKAi!",
      "say": "Meet, B. K. A. I.!",
      "speed": 0.95,
      "pause": 1.7
    },
    {
      "id": "f1",
      "text": "Ask anything, in Vietnamese, the way you'd ask a friend.",
      "speed": 1.02,
      "pause": 1.5
    },
    {
      "id": "f2",
      "text": "A team of AI agents finds the facts, in about two seconds.",
      "say": "A team of A.I. agents finds the facts, in about two seconds.",
      "speed": 1.02,
      "pause": 1.5
    },
    {
      "id": "f3",
      "text": "Every number comes with its source, and is checked before you see it.",
      "speed": 1.02,
      "pause": 1.6
    },
    {
      "id": "f4",
      "text": "Rather talk? Just speak. You can even interrupt!",
      "speed": 1.02,
      "pause": 1.5
    },
    {
      "id": "f5",
      "text": "It remembers your scores, and suggests majors that fit you.",
      "speed": 1.02,
      "pause": 1.5
    },
    {
      "id": "f6",
      "text": "And every answer can be traced, step by step.",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "pause": 1.6
    },
    {
